 ],
 "notes": "Key and topic policies accept planned JSON, declared jsonencode text, separate aws_kms_key_policy, or a policy document referenced by the key/topic policy (planned policy is unknown when it references the topic ARN). topic_policy_publish binds Allow + SNS publish + the budgets principal to one statement; the threshold, comparison and email are bound to one notification."
